chronic kidney disease#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)":[37,39],"#DHerbKB for CKD: knowledge base of diet and toxic herbal medicines for clinical support of chronic kidney disease#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)#{1}":[38,39],"#DHerbKB for CKD: knowledge base of diet and toxic herbal medicines for clinical support of chronic kidney disease#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[40,42],"#DHerbKB for CKD: knowledge base of diet and toxic herbal medicines for clinical support of chronic kidney disease#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)#{1}":[41,42],"#DHerbKB for CKD: knowledge base of diet and toxic herbal medicines for clinical support of chronic kidney disease#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[43,44]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/Q7ADB7DS","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/7ZKK4GVB?page=1&annotation=INM2RHUR","line":35},{"title":"Sayfa 5","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/7ZKK4GVB?page=5&annotation=3UAGV47N","line":38},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/7ZKK4GVB?page=1&annotation=72YXN6RG","line":41}],"metadata":{"Title":"DHerbKB for CKD: knowledge base of diet and toxic herbal medicines for clinical support of chronic kidney disease","Authors":"Huai-Yu Wang, Chi Yuan, Yi-Heng Zhao, Yan Yi, Yi-Nuo Chen, Yelin Li, Dongyuan Chang, Xiaomeng Lin, Ji Wang, Sydney Chi Wai Tang, Qi Wang, Min Chen","Year":2025,"DOI":"10.1186/s12967-025-07178-8","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"To evaluate the DHerbKB, CKD cases with different complications were designed, and full-day dietary schedules covering 136 foods/cuisines were extracted from guidelines/literatures.","Findings":"By integrating multiple guidelines, individualized recommendations were manually extracted and structured on the intake of protein, energy, sodium, potassium, and phosphorus for CKD management","Conclusions":"The DHerbKB integrated and transformed the knowledge and data of CKD dietary management and toxic Chinese herbal medicines control into an easy-to-use and reliable system. Resource covered by the DHerbKB are opened for future researches regarding CKD care, toxic herbs control and related artificial intelligence.","Limitations":"","User_Notes":"böbrek has için çok iyi bir veritabanı olmuş table derste kullanılabilir.  ama ai destekli mi anlamadım, dığrula"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"1k5vq0t","at":1774939672283}},"smart_blocks:wangDHerbKBCKDKnowledge2025.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.08918604,0.01082465,0.03928284,-0.02805392,-0.00253527,-0.0609882,0.02970925,0.04478299,-0.04264401,0.01810068,-0.00947252,-0.09585962,0.02421128,0.05339596,0.0214754,0.00688272,0.05921973,0.00335706,-0.04116763,0.013779,0.09298838,-0.04883887,0.00756773,-0.00989749,0.01139309,-0.00259997,0.04171768,-0.02432826,-0.0158076,-0.19710155,0.04078065,-0.01684493,0.05628671,-0.04382511,-0.0364517,-0.04002864,0.00455758,0.06323907,-0.0323378,0.00322851,0.07896724,0.03226407,0.04950772,0.01864377,-0.01476097,-0.0491549,-0.05481747,0.00623106,0.00605868,-0.00560146,-0.04277217,-0.02927173,0.05467262,0.02484799,0.07319567,-0.02722194,0.05703191,0.02510334,0.05606443,0.11906271,0.04764118,0.03431014,-0.21334267,0.09561714,-0.03541016,0.05328679,-0.0512528,0.05257235,0.05351838,-0.02788218,-0.02851933,-0.00615674,0.03406322,0.03290451,-0.0126648,-0.0316533,0.0139811,-0.01201107,-0.07000189,0.01689113,-0.0231911,0.10769204,0.03201944,-0.05171618,-0.02629592,-0.02092185,-0.02386593,-0.02509861,0.01313446,0.00125136,0.00872204,-0.00219121,0.02861981,-0.00139708,-0.05247299,-0.01705226,0.00691232,-0.02591957,-0.09008704,0.09593979,-0.06775597,0.0133063,-0.03113487,-0.03131219,0.03223478,-0.02755891,-0.04558685,-0.02257521,0.00516309,0.00974814,0.04298306,0.01154803,0.03455339,-0.01386607,-0.00710434,0.05882148,0.106755,0.02122698,0.014520